# Normalize line endings to LF, on every platform and in every export.
#
# The repository is already all-LF, but `git archive` applies the same conversion
# as a checkout — so on a machine with core.autocrlf=true it produced an archive
# with CRLF in 94 files, and the Magento coding standard flagged every one of them.
# Pinning it here makes the release archive identical no matter who builds it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.zip binary
